      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_25660d2334bc84a56b5c614dc67a6ad2f4c9a303ad90c13b93133fce55937138",
        "slc_b215dad4d5d087702f54b8d5bf2c21353b8af447c3f491b56c37c82399f10835"
      ],
      "text": "Repository development practice: the merge gate is four root commands (format, lint, typecheck, test) run via pnpm/Nx, with CI running a code-consistency workflow using nx affected on touched projects and dependents, and browser Vitest projects skipped in CI."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
